	"Name": "Fippsie's Buildable Arches",
	"Author": "Fippsie",
	"Description": "[center]You can decide which Arch(es) you want! :) Just download the one(s) you like.\n<br />\n<br />[img]https://abload.de/img/buttons1jtd.png[/img]\uFEFF\n<br />\n<br />1. Install the latest version of [url=https://smapi.io/]SMAPI\uFEFF[/url]\uFEFF.\n<br />2. Install the latest version of [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1820]TMXLoader\uFEFF[/url]\uFEFF.\n<br />3. Install the latest version of [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1726]PyTK[/url]\uFEFF.\n<br />4. Download the mod anywhere and then unzip the folder into &#92;Stardew Valley&#92;Mods&#92;.\u00A0\n<br />5. Run the game using SMAPI.\n<br />\n<br />To uninstall, just delete it from the mods folder.\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />[img]https://abload.de/img/button3bljhi.png[/img]\n<br />\n<br />- Adds up to 4 new Buildables to your game that you can buy by pressing F2. This open's up TMXLoader's Building Interface.\n<br />- Decorative Gates / Arches that you can walk through!\n<br />\n<br />If you have any suggestions or find any bugs please let me know![/center]",
